  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think it would be best if there was an option to change the \"here\" tab list from alphabetical with friends on top, to a list by the reverse order in which they enter the room.  In other words, last in would be the first name.  (and blocked names at the very top, along with those who've blocked you, showing to everyone not only the instance owner) this would greatly help moderators to quickly find those people who just jump into a world and start causing difficulty because they will most likely be at the top of the list.  It can simply be a toggle to have it alphabetical or in entry order last to first.",
